          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmwatoeesye ũvani, na nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmwamũvĩtanĩsye Yeova, na mũtyaaĩthukĩĩsya wasya wa Yeova, kana kũendaa mĩaonĩ yake, kana myamũlonĩ yake, kana mokũsĩnĩ make; kwondũ wa ũu ũthũku ũũ nĩmũvikĩĩte, o ũndũ kũilyĩ ũmũnthĩ. ",
